  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for development of North Macedonia National Development Strategy &#x2013; Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2021 national institutions in North Macedonia began the preparations for developing a National Development Strategy for the upcoming twenty years, through a project supported by the British Embassy Skopje Good Governance Fund and implemented by the UNDP in coordination with RCO North Macedonia to ensure that that the collective UN expertise is utilized in the process where needed. One milestone of the process was in March 2022 when the Government adopted the proposed methodological framework</narrative>
  </description>
